<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Defend Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 40
 Dark Knight Level 40
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> defend
</pre>
<p>While known for their headstrong rushes into combat, the Barbarian may also 
consider a more restrained approach to combat when the situation calls for it. 
By defending, the skilled Barbarian enters a state of preparedness to wait for 
an incoming attack. The next blow aimed at them is blocked, and the attacker is 
left reeling, slower to strike again. That ends the defence.
</p><p>Taking up a defensive position takes 100 endurance. With less you only exhaust 
yourself, and if you fail you fall over. The focus required to defend prevents 
almost all other actions: you can still look around, check yourself (score, 
status, inventory, equipment, affect) and taunt, which goes well with it. Enter 
defend a second time to stop defending.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
